      "shows": [
        "Published by",
        "Published floors",
        "Blessed on"
      ],
      "panel": "p-venue"
    },
    {
      "el": "**Serving is not a guarantee.** What a venue serves is what it can do for an operator, so no floor compares those rows. A feature it serves can still be refused before spend by what the job image lacks.",
      "kind": "readme",
      "status": "new",
      "source": "admin/src/console/panels/venue.mjs#venueServes",
      "golden": [
        "panels/venue-openshell.operator"
