      "el": "**Other gateway words a host can publish.** Not local (every job there is refused as `openshell-gateway-not-local`), unread (the gateway did not answer when the worker started), and not published.",
      "kind": "readme",
      "status": "new",
      "source": "admin/src/console/panels/venue.mjs#venueHosts",
      "golden": [
        "panels/venue-gateway-remote.operator"
