      ],
      "panel": "p-venue-hosts"
    },
    {
      "el": "**When an observation does not hold.** *Credentials stay on owned networks* is enforced only where the gateway is local. On a host where the observation fails, the word drops to asserted, and a floor asking for enforced refuses there. The fix is to run the gateway on that host and register it on loopback (`openshell gateway add https://127.0.0.1:17670 --local`); a remote gateway is refused, not lowered.",
      "kind": "readme",
      "status": "new",
      "source": "admin/src/console/panels/venue.mjs#venueFix",
      "golden": [
        "panels/venue-openshell.operator"
      ],
      "shows": [
        "drops to asserted",
        "floor asking for enforced refuses",
        "gateway",
        "https://127.0.0.1:17670",
        "--local",
        "Copy"
      ],
      "panel": "p-venue-fix"
    },
